# =============================================================================
# AI Data Readiness Auditor - Example environment file
# =============================================================================
#
# HOW TO USE (no coding needed):
#   1. Make a COPY of this file in the same folder and name the copy ".env"
#      (just ".env", with the dot and nothing after it).
#   2. Open your new ".env" file.
#   3. Delete the "#" in front of ONE provider's two lines below, and paste
#      your real API key after the "=" sign.
#   4. Save the file, then start the app. That's it.
#
# NOTES:
#   - The app works WITHOUT any key (it uses the offline Template Engine Mode).
#     You only need a key if you want LLM Enhanced Mode.
#   - Pick ONLY ONE provider. Do not fill in more than one.
#   - Never share your ".env" file or your key. It is ignored by git on purpose.
#   - After adding a key, choose "LLM Enhanced Mode" in the app sidebar.
# =============================================================================


# --- Option 1: OpenAI -------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=paste-your-openai-key-here

# --- Option 2: Groq (fast, free tier available) -----------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# GROQ_API_KEY=paste-your-groq-key-here

# --- Option 3: OpenRouter ---------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=openrouter
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=paste-your-openrouter-key-here

# --- Option 4: Google Gemini ------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=paste-your-gemini-key-here

# --- Option 5: Anthropic Claude ---------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=claude
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=paste-your-anthropic-key-here

# --- Option 6: Azure OpenAI -------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=azure_openai
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=paste-your-azure-key-here
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource-name.openai.azure.com
# AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=your-deployment-name


# --- Optional advanced overrides (leave commented unless you need them) ------
# LLM_MODEL=            # force a specific model name
# LLM_BASE_URL=         # override the API base URL
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-06-01
